  "name": "North American West Coast Temperature logger (TPOD) data (supports acoustic data), 1997-present",
  "description": "Data from temperature loggers (TPODS) deployed at various locations along west coast North America for 1 to 2 weeks` duration, 4 to 70m, at various times of the year.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Data collected in support of acoustical research data.\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Data not well documented and requires knowledge to interpret. Risk of Loss: High Impact Justification: Data used for one time analysis. Impact of Loss: Low Recommended Action: Bring data to archives",
